   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Tarrel my beloved,\r\n\r\nNot a day goes by that I don't lose myself thinking of those bronze braids, that bellowing laugh, or those rippling forearms.\r\n\r\nYou must come to me in Auberdine on the next ship. We belong together--you know it to be true if you search your heart!\r\n\r\nYours if you'll have me,\r\n\r\nHollee",
   "time": 1791847579,
   "title": "Hollee's Note",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Darkshore"
  },
  "5ed600b2": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1426,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Hello there again.  I'm Gubber Blump.\r\n\r\nI hope you are doing real well.  I hope you are still fishing too.  I love fishing.  The Blump family is known for fishing.  Here is a bauble, so that you can fish a little better.  I love using them when I fish.  Good luck, and thank you again for helping me catch them groupers from before.\r\n\r\nKeep on fishing!\r\n\r\nGubber Blump",
   "time": 1791754721,
   "title": "Plain Letter",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Dun Morogh"
  },
  "833cf145": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1426,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Greetings, young $c!\r\n\r\nI'm quite proud of the effort you put into the training given to you thus far.  You should feel proud to have become one with the Claw.  More such lessons will be given; the next of your lessons will be available once you have reached at least 14th level.  When you are ready at that time, seek me out in the Cenarion Enclave of Darnassus.\r\n\r\nMathrengyl Bearwalker",
   "time": 1791756783,
   "title": "Plain Letter",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Dun Morogh"
  }
 },
