   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Darkshore"
  },
  "4156|279d82d3": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1457,
   "name": "Astaia",
   "npc": "4156",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Your skill exceeds mine, though  I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of \"The Bass and You\".  That is sure to help you increase your skill.",
   "time": 1791796419,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Darnassus"
  },
  "4160|126c2b9a": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1457,
   "name": "Ainethil",
   "npc": "4160",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "This potion seems to heal less damage every time I brew it, though I use the same ingredients. There can be only one conclusion: the plants are changing. I cannot say why or into what.",
   "time": 1791855237,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Darnassus"
  },
  "4210|0c543544": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1457,
   "name": "Alegorn",
   "npc": "4210",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Cooking is a life long pursuit and I see we share the same passion!",
   "time": 1791855207,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Darnassus"
  },
  "4211|a28d29e1": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1457,
   "name": "Dannelor",
   "npc": "4211",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I can train you in First Aid techniques.",
   "time": 1791855185,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Darnassus"
  },
  "4219|34f0a84a": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1457,
   "name": "Fylerian Nightwing",
   "npc": "4219",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Welcome, my sister.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.\n\nThere are rumors of strife within the Cenarion Circle, but you should pay such loose talk no heed.  Our Arch $C, Fandral Staghelm, leads us and all of Teldrassil to glory!",
   "time": 1791796492,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Darnassus"
  },
  "4753|b87a8862": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1457,
   "name": "Jartsam",
   "npc": "4753",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I can teach you the finer points of Tiger Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!",
   "time": 1791855153,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Darnassus"
  },
  "5482|8cd6b7fd": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1453,
   "name": "Stephen Ryback",
   "npc": "5482",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I don't get too many cooks in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you're ready.",
   "time": 1791849634,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Stormwind City"
  },
  "5483|877c4b1d": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1453,
   "name": "Erika Tate",
   "npc": "5483",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin.",
   "time": 1791849991,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Stormwind City"
  },
  "6569|58cd03a1": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1455,
   "name": "Gnoarn",
   "npc": "6569",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Where Troggs and Leper Gnomes roam stands our home - Gnomeregan.\n\nOur families lost, our homes displaced. Scattered.\n\nOh how I long for the days of carefree Gnomeregan life, but those days are no more. We must make our stand! We must save Gnomeregan!",
   "time": 1791751225,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Ironforge"
  },
  "7954|fd743840": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1426,
   "name": "Binjy Featherwhistle",
   "npc": "7954",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You need to be exalted with the gnomes of the Gnomeregan Exiles before I will teach you how to pilot a Mechanostrider, $c.",
   "time": 1791755591,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Dun Morogh"
  },
  "7955|53cc47ec": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1426,
   "name": "Milli Featherwhistle",
   "npc": "7955",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Erm... I really don't know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechanostrider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered exalted amongst the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as exalted to Gnomeregan, I'd be happy to show you what I have to offer.",
   "time": 1791755593,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Dun Morogh"
  },
